# ── Expression lowering (split out of lower.gg) ──────────────────────
# The core expression lowerer: block-as-expression / tail-value lowering,
# if-chain expressions, `lower_expr` / `lower_expr_inner`, `lower_call`,
# and the ctor-arg container-hint helper. Moved verbatim from lower.gg as
# part of the lower.gg module split (output-neutral pure function move).
